<title>LIECHTENSTEIN: SOCCER-LIECHTENSTEIN AND LITHUANIA DRAWING 0-0 AT HALFTIME.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LIECHTENSTEIN AND LITHUANIA DRAWING 0-0 AT HALFTIME.</headline>
<dateline>VADUZ, Liechtenstein 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liechtenstein and</p>
<p>Lithuania were drawing 0-0 at halftime in their World Cup soccer</p>
<p>European group eight qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
